/**
 * The RootSystem class models the root system of a plant and is responsible for
 * various calculations related to hydraulic conductance, nitrogen flux, and ABA
 * biosynthesis.
 */

/**
 * RootBase serves as the the base for the root system to collect its child information for solving
 * water flux allocation between different layers. This class may include summarised variables that define
 * the root's physical attributes, nutritional status, and more. It may also have summarised information
 * for growth simulation, nutrient uptake, and interaction with the soil environment.
 * 
 * ONE OF THE REASON THAT ROOTBASE EXTENDS Organ is because we used root based in the XEG reader to serve
 * as a base for provide PlantIdentifier and run the fromXNode function. 
 */
module RootBase extends Organ
{	
